    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired by mid-afternoon; no fever; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Numbness and clumsiness of the fingers; Lhermitte&apos;s sign; no weakness of the legs, imbalance or visual change</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary urgency or burning; last period three weeks ago</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No blurred vision or pain on moving the eyes</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No back pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Frightened and tearful about her playing; PHQ-9 7, GAD-7 6; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

